From: FunnyPlaying RetroPixel Pocket port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: build rk3326-funnyplaying-rppocket.dtb

Register the RetroPixel Pocket device tree in the arm64/rockchip DTB
build list so that the ROCKNIX image ships it alongside the other
RK3326 handheld DTBs.

The .dts source itself is placed in this project's out-of-tree DTS
directory (projects/ROCKNIX/devices/RK3326/linux/dts/rockchip/) and
rsync'd into the kernel source tree by
projects/ROCKNIX/packages/linux/package.mk:post_patch().

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
@@ -43,6 +43,7 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += rk3308-roc-cc.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += rk3326-anbernic-rg351m.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += rk3326-anbernic-rg351v.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += rk3326-funnyplaying-rppocket.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += rk3326-gameforce-chi.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += rk3326-odroid-go2.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += rk3326-odroid-go2-v11.dtb
